/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (One of the most exciting aspects of my internship was the project I was assigned: the development of TECH HR, an Integrated HR Management Platform tailored for small IT companies. The system is designed to streamline various HR processes with three key user roles: HR Administrator, who manages human resources, training, and payroll; Employee, who can view tasks, track progress, and update task status; and Manager, who is responsible for assigning and overseeing tasks. TECH HR aims to enhance efficiency in HR management, task distribution, and employee engagement.)
/E (One of the most exciting aspects of my internship was the project I was assigned: the development of TECH HR, an Integrated HR Management Platform tailored for small IT companies. The system is designed to streamline various HR processes with three key user roles: HR Administrator, who manages human resources, training, and payroll; Employee, who can view tasks, track progress, and update task status; and Manager, who is responsible for assigning and overseeing tasks. TECH HR aims to enhance efficiency in HR management, task distribution, and employee engagement.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
