/T (In this chapter, we dive into the crucial phase of realizing our project. After defining the requirements and specifications in the previous chapters, we now explore the complex aspects that contribute to the creation of our system. The realization encompasses essential elements, from the development environment to user interfaces, as well as sequence and class diagrams. This chapter provides a comprehensive overview of the project's execution, focusing on technological choices, development tools, and a detailed description of the key user interfaces that play a central role in the user experience. It represents a fundamental step in the realization of our project, and we are excited to guide you through its complexities.)
