405 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In our project, we used the PERN stack. The PERN stack is a modern and powerful web development stack consisting of PostgreSQL, Express.js, React, and Node.js. It is widely recognized for its efficiency and scalability in building dynamic web applications. This stack provides a complete ecosystem for creating robust web applications, including essential tools such as routing, authentication, and database management. While the stack relies on JavaScript for both client and server-side development, I used the MUI library for React to streamline development and improve the user interface design. Additionally, Prisma was used as an ORM \(Object Relational Mapping\) to handle database operations efficiently and seamlessly integrate PostgreSQL with the application. This combination of technologies made the project highly versatile and ideal for scalable web applications.)
/E (In our project, we used the PERN stack. The PERN stack is a modern and powerful web development stack consisting of PostgreSQL, Express.js, React, and Node.js. It is widely recognized for its efficiency and scalability in building dynamic web applications. This stack provides a complete ecosystem for creating robust web applications, including essential tools such as routing, authentication, and database management. While the stack relies on JavaScript for both client and server-side development, I used the MUI library for React to streamline development and improve the user interface design. Additionally, Prisma was used as an ORM \(Object Relational Mapping\) to handle database operations efficiently and seamlessly integrate PostgreSQL with the application. This combination of technologies made the project highly versatile and ideal for scalable web applications.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
