/T (Prisma : is an ORM \(Object-Relational Mapping\) tool for Node.js and TypeScript that simplifies database interactions. It provides an easy-to-use API to query, insert, update, and delete data from relational databases like PostgreSQL, helping developers work with databases more efficiently while maintaining type safety and performance.)
