<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (In conclusion of my internship at Elitech Consulting, I would like to express my sincere gratitude to the entire team for giving me the opportunity to learn and grow within this dynamic company. My experience over the past few months has been exceptional, providing me with a deep understanding of web development, especially through the HR management system project I worked on.)
/E (In conclusion of my internship at Elitech Consulting, I would like to express my sincere gratitude to the entire team for giving me the opportunity to learn and grow within this dynamic company. My experience over the past few months has been exceptional, providing me with a deep understanding of web development, especially through the HR management system project I worked on.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
477 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H2
/T (During this time, I had the privilege of gaining practical expertise in using the PERN stack \(PostgreSQL, Express.js, React, Node.js\), a modern and powerful tool for building dynamic web applications. I was able to apply these newly acquired skills to design and implement a sophisticated HR management system. This project was an invaluable learning experience, allowing me to enhance my skills in backend development, user interface design, and database management.)
/E (During this time, I had the privilege of gaining practical expertise in using the PERN stack \(PostgreSQL, Express.js, React, Node.js\), a modern and powerful tool for building dynamic web applications. I was able to apply these newly acquired skills to design and implement a sophisticated HR management system. This project was an invaluable learning experience, allowing me to enhance my skills in backend development, user interface design, and database management.)
/Alt ()
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [3]
>>
endobj
